2. Data
   internal/route/prefixes.json is generated by tools/genprefixes.py from public
   RIPEstat "announced-prefixes" data (https://stat.ripe.net/) plus a short
   hand-maintained list documented inside the file. The 12 probe targets in
   internal/route/targets.json are publicly known DNS resolver addresses of
   Chinese carriers.

